  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A remote control used to link with a controllable drone via radio signals. The controller has a range of 60 ft. The controller can only link with one drone at a time, and the drone must be CR 1/4 or lower. Talk to your DM about drone creature statistics.</p><p>You may use the controller as an action to have the drone perform an action. If the action is the Attack action, it may only make one attack with this action, even if it can normally make more through the multiattack action. If the drone can act autonomously, doing this consumes the drone's reaction for the round.</p>",
